{"id":104,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"وَيْلٌۭ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍۢ لُّمَزَةٍ","transliteration":"Waylul-likulli humazatil-lumazatin","translation":"Woe to every scorner and mocker"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًۭا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Alladhī jamaʿa mālaw-waʿaddadah","translation":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Yaḥsabu anna mālahu akhladah","translation":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal."},{"number":4,"arabicText":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","transliteration":"Kallā layunbadhanna fī l-ḥuṭamat","translation":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā l-ḥuṭamat","translation":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","transliteration":"Nāru l-lahi l-mūqadat","translation":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled,"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","transliteration":"Allatī taṭṭaliʿu ʿalā l-afidat","translation":"Which mounts directed at the hearts."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Innahā ʿalayhim mu'ṣadatun","translation":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"فِى عَمَدٍۢ مُّمَدَّدَةٍۭ","transliteration":"Fī ʿamadim-mumaddadatin","translation":"In extended columns."}]}